Python

cd solar-hunter/scripts/

  - scripts/01_serial_bridge.sh – /dev/ttyACM0 serial bridge with S-curve
    smoothing
  - scripts/02_description_rviz.sh – robot description + RViz (real hardware,
    not mock)
  - scripts/03_object_detection.sh – camera-index-5 object detection
  - scripts/04_visual_servoing.sh – C++ visual servoing node with S-curve
    smoothing
  - scripts/run_all.sh – launches all four in separate xterm windows (since
    this machine has xterm but no tmux/gnome-terminal), with
    SERIAL_PORT/CAMERA_INDEX overridable via env vars
  - scripts/stop_all.sh – kills all four by process name
  
